  "question": {
    "text": "Two oxides of nitrogen, <math> <mrow> <mtext>NO</mtext></mrow> </math> and <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> are allowed to react together at <math> <mrow> <mtext>243</mtext><mtext> </mtext><mtext>K</mtext></mrow> </math> and form coloured compound of nitrogen (X). When compound (X) reacts with water to yield another compound of nitrogen (Y). The shape of the anion (Y) molecule is"
